        "name": "Exposure",
        "score": 1,
        "rationale": "On an HTTP error the script prints the first 2000 characters of the CRM response body to stderr, so the body and any contact record its message repeats would land in the public log, and the test even asserts the body text is present; only the Authorization header is kept out."
